```

`AtLeastNumCharsRemaining` reads `str[i]` until it hits `\0`. The buffer is null-terminated at `Buffer[Size]`. So it stops at the null and returns false. So `ParseIdentifier` returns false before reaching `MaybeAppendWithLength`. Hmm.

